  \end{align*}

- Let $P$ be the set of products, indexed by ProductName:
  \begin{align*}
  &\text{Smartphone:} \quad \text{Value}=200, \quad \text{Weight}=1.0 \\
  &\text{Laptop:} \quad \text{Value}=1500, \quad \text{Weight}=5.0 \\
